    "title": "Collaborative Working and Version Control with git[hub]",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14623257",
    "publication_date": "2025-01-09",
    "description": "<p>This slide deck introduces the version control tool git, related terminology and the Github Desktop app for managing files in Git[hub] repositories. We furthermore dive into:<br>* Working with repositories<br>* Collaborative with others<br>* Github-Zenodo integration<br>* Github pages<br>* Artificial Intelligence answering Github Issues</p>",
